    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101403" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συσσείω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shake together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τείχη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Polyaen.
					6.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ πτερῷ τοῦ κρατῆρος τὴν βάσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					11.17.4
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				966b12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Him.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>make to tremble</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ps.</u>
				28(29).8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph. of
			intoxication, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνέσεισέ μ᾽ ἐκποθεῖσα φιάλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Xenarch.
					2.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
